# ── The paper itself, and private submission material ────────────────
# This repository is the evaluation artifact: harness, register, specs,
# test suites and raw results. The manuscript is not part of it. It was
# briefly published here by accident; the paper is the journal's to
# distribute, and keeping a copy here also made it ambiguous which
# version was canonical. Generated locally and kept out of git.
